# crease: the knob extremes on the highest and lowest notes, with the hardest parameter moves: P1 0 then 255, P2 0
# then 255, attack 0 and release 0 (the fastest envelope the OS makes), and notes retriggered on the same voice.
tempo 140
steps 24
tail 3.0
track lead
preset 0 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 255 0 128 255 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 255 8
param p2 255 8
note 8 C0 4 127
note 8 C8 4 127
param p1 0 12
param p2 0 12
note 12 C4 1 127
note 12 C4 1 127
note 12 C4 1 127
note 13 G4 1 127
note 14 C5 1 127
expect sound 0 20
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 40
